	(text_box "Three 0-10 V ADC inputs use a 100 k over 33 k divider and one 100 nF ADC capacitor per channel. Place each divider/filter group at J24, not at the MCU. Four ground-referenced 0-10 V outputs use individual 0805 resistors for the approved two-stage 10 k / 1 uF and 10 k / 100 nF PWM filters. A TLV2374 is powered from a local 12 V rail and uses 22 k / 10 k feedback for a nominal gain of 3.2, leaving calibration headroom for exactly 10 V."
